00:016:03.000 --> 00:016:05.000
Allahu Akbar

00:016:05.000 --> 00:016:11.000
Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah, Wahdahu La Shareeka Lah

00:016:11.000 --> 00:016:13.000
Al-Salaamu ‘Alaykum

00:016:13.000 --> 00:016:14.000
Al-Salaamu ‘Alaykum

00:016:18.000 --> 00:016:21.000
This is why it is appropriate to say Congratulations at the end of the prayer

00:016:21.000 --> 00:016:24.000
because we just received a gift from God,

00:016:24.000 --> 00:016:27.000
the equivalent of a hundred million dollars in your account.

00:016:27.000 --> 00:016:31.000
Congratulations.

